{"unit_id":"baizhizzl__dsh-network-proxy#feature-1","repo":"baizhizzl/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"9f5024c7d28070a2db0f6fa423e9474261d8c76a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@local/dsh-network-proxy 的功能「选择代理模式」：在通用设置中选择直连、跟随系统或自定义代理；自定义模式接受带端口的 HTTP/HTTPS 地址，保存后应用到 Harness 网络请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:666-676","index.js:1233-1244","index.js:1309-1340"]}
{"unit_id":"baizhizzl__dsh-network-proxy#feature-2","repo":"baizhizzl/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"9f5024c7d28070a2db0f6fa423e9474261d8c76a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@local/dsh-network-proxy 的功能「检测系统代理」：跟随系统模式读取 Windows 或 macOS 的系统代理配置，并支持 PAC 配置与旁路规则；界面可重新检测并显示当前代理状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:812-910","client.js:20-50"]}
{"unit_id":"baizhizzl__dsh-network-proxy#feature-3","repo":"baizhizzl/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"9f5024c7d28070a2db0f6fa423e9474261d8c76a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@local/dsh-network-proxy 的功能「切换进程代理」：将策略安装为 Harness 的 undici 全局 dispatcher，使进程内 fetch 按目标地址选择代理；回环地址和配置的旁路主机直接连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:973-992","index.js:1042-1064","index.js:1136-1167"]}
{"unit_id":"baizhizzl__dsh-network-proxy#feature-4","repo":"baizhizzl/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"9f5024c7d28070a2db0f6fa423e9474261d8c76a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@local/dsh-network-proxy 的功能「保存代理偏好」：模式和自定义地址写入 DSH_HOME/network-proxy.json，启动时读取；停用时恢复原 dispatcher 与环境变量。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:67-102","index.js:1169-1207","index.js:1365-1390"]}
{"unit_id":"baizhizzl__dsh-network-proxy#caveat-1","repo":"baizhizzl/dsh-network-proxy","commit":"9f5024c7d28070a2db0f6fa423e9474261d8c76a","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@local/dsh-network-proxy 会把代理模式和自定义地址保存为本地 JSON；自定义地址若含凭据，凭据也会写入该文件。代码以 0600 权限创建文件，默认位置为 ~/.dsh/network-proxy.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:67-72","index.js:93-100"]}
